{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1241768-is-there-a-legit-way-to-get-wfhw-if-you-missed-the-kickstarter","id":1241768,"title":"Is there a legit way to get WFHW if you missed the Kickstarter?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-08-02T05:24:00-07:00","id":1241768,"title":"Is there a legit way to get WFHW if you missed the Kickstarter?","content":"Looking through the forum threads, and even talking to my RL friends, I'm starting to feel like I'm the only person who was late to the kickstarter party. I missed out on getting the WFHW manuscript. I was living at a blockade camp, far away from everything except a coal baron's sinister ambitions. I've googled around a few times, and all I've turned up is an option on the OPP website to pre-order the pdf when it's released. Is there any legitimate way to lay my disconcertingly eager hands on that manuscript, or do I have to wait until late 2019?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24421-katamari_naneke","name":"Katamari_Naneke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-02T05:25:50-07:00","id":1241770,"title":"","content":"<a href=\"https://what-fire-has-wrought.backerkit.com/hosted_preorders\" target=\"_blank\">https://what-fire-has-wrought.backer...sted_preorders</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Amateur drawsmith","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2847-thatsmellygoblin","name":"ThatSmellyGoblin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2847_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"188"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-02T05:45:53-07:00","id":1241776,"title":"","content":"Those are preorders, so I don't think they'll get you the backer manuscript any earlier. <br /> <br /> So, no, I do not believe there is any <i>legitimate</i> means of accessing the manuscript at this moment if you missed the kickstarter.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-02T05:57:00-07:00","id":1241780,"title":"","content":"Actually, I'm fairly confident you <i>are </i>able to get the backer manuscript when you preorder.<br /> <br /> edit for future readers: I was wrong. Scion used backerkit to send out previews since they came out after the fact, instead of during the kickstarter in a backer only update.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":1542,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","user":"MoroseMorgan","date":". 08-09-2018, 11:15 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-02T07:28:12-07:00","id":1241814,"title":"","content":"oh, ok then.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-02T09:12:35-07:00","id":1241863,"title":"","content":"Sorry to be brief earlier, I've been on a priority outage bridge since 2am, and was idly posting to keep myself awake, didn't mean to be brief and or contrary.<br /> <br /> To be a bit more precist, IIRC, when you &quot;pre-order&quot; through the backerkit link, you get access to all of the backer updates from the kickstarter, including the consolidated manuscript download link.<br /> <br /> edit: again, I was wrong. Please disregard.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":1542,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","user":"MoroseMorgan","date":". 08-09-2018, 11:16 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-03T18:22:43-07:00","id":1242557,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure. I pre-ordered the pdf, but I still can't find a link where I can download the manuscript. I'm chasing it up with backerkit support, but they don't seem to know what I'm talking about. I'll update when I find out if it works or not. Thanks for the advice, regardless.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24421-katamari_naneke","name":"Katamari_Naneke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-03T18:31:32-07:00","id":1242560,"title":"","content":"The backer links should be on the KS updates. Not in Backerkit. I have no idea if you get access to it for pre-ordering, though. Somehow I doubt it because the pre-order is with Backerkit which is separate from Kickstarter.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ekorrengames.com\" target=\"_blank\">ekorrengames.com</a><br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ekorren\" target=\"_blank\">youtube.com/@ekorren</a>","edited":{"userid":482,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","user":"Ekorren","date":". 08-03-2018, 09:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/482-ekorren","name":"Ekorren","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar482_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"705"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-04T23:12:40-07:00","id":1242887,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ekorren</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1241768-is-there-a-legit-way-to-get-wfhw-if-you-missed-the-kickstarter?p=1242560#post1242560\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The backer links should be on the KS updates. Not in Backerkit. I have no idea if you get access to it for pre-ordering, though. Somehow I doubt it because the pre-order is with Backerkit which is separate from Kickstarter.</div> </div> </div> </div>I did hosted preorders for Open Legend. Checking, it shows me all the updates <i>except</i> backer updates. Those it just skips entirely.<br /> <br /> So by default you can't see backers only updates. OPP might have it set up to give you the manuscript anyway, but that'd be something I think they'd have to do on purpose.<br /> <br /> You should probably e-mail them and ask.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3487-jetstream","name":"Jetstream","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3487_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"572"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-08T02:11:44-07:00","id":1243734,"title":"","content":"Ok, I emailed the publisher through Kickstarter and the Backerkit support, and I haven't got super clear answer from either one, but I'm increasingly getting the impression that this isn't gonna bear fruit. Thanks for your suggestions, mates.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24421-katamari_naneke","name":"Katamari_Naneke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-09T08:11:19-07:00","id":1244148,"title":"","content":"James Bell said as much on the DB comment section too when I asked. I think I got confused, because they sent out a preview manuscript for Scion through backerkit, instead of backer only messages. Although, his comment hinted at the backer PDF being forthcoming, which sounds like it means that pre-orders get to review that as well.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksha are my fae-vorite.<br /> <br /> Reincarnation of magnificentmomo.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1542-morosemorgan","name":"MoroseMorgan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1542_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"778"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-09T08:53:53-07:00","id":1244163,"title":"","content":"If my experience with this is how it normally works, then no, you can't get the backer manuscripts, but yes you will get the backer pdf, if you order through BackerKit instead of supporting the campaign through Kickstarter.<br /> <br /> This happened to me with Changeling: The Lost 2e. I couldn't back the Kickstarter, but later made a pledge through BackerKit. I never got the preview manuscripts, but did get the backer pdf.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2746-tgueiros","name":"TGUEIROS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2746_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1393"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-08-09T18:01:40-07:00","id":1244334,"title":"","content":"I just reread my comment and realised how it sounds. I definitely meant &quot;thanks for trying to help,&quot; not a snarky &quot;thanks for nothing.&quot; Sorry if I came off as rude.<br /> <br /> Also, I got firmer confirmation in answer to questions put to the developers via Kickstarter, there definitely won't be a manuscript coming from that angle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24421-katamari_naneke","name":"Katamari_Naneke","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"83"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}